<lb n="18"/>ten wüßte, dan wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gentzlichen</unclear> nit vorhabens <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">un</unclear> ge=
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sint</unclear>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frömbden</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußlëndischen</unclear> etwas wider
<lb n="20"/>die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffzuhalten</unclear>, sonder einem jeden, was
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">göttlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichen</unclear> rechten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuegehört</unclear>, nach=
